{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-phone-shop-2-01","date":"2026-11-26","surface":"phone","area":"phone/shop-2","refs":["F-phone-424"],"proof":"code-read","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open","lens":"10","severity":"S4","title":"Message your gym calls the same people 'Gym admin' on the button and 'front desk' in the line under it","what":"When a member sends feedback or a complaint, the two choices are 'Gym owner' and 'Gym admin', and each sent message is labelled 'To: Gym admin'. The line right under the choice then says 'the owner and front desk' read it. Everywhere else the app says front desk or desk, and 'admin app' is the owner's own app, so 'Gym admin' reads like the owner.","expected":"One name for the same people everywhere: 'Front desk' on the choice, on the sent message and in the line under it.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/shop/gymMessages.ts:170-172","apps/mobile/src/shop/gymMessages.ts:179","apps/mobile/src/shop/gymMessages.ts:236-238","apps/mobile/src/shop/gymTalk.ts:91-93","apps/mobile/src/shop/staffDoor.ts:72"],"root_cause_key":"desk-called-gym-admin","who":"members","how_often":"every feedback or complaint","fix_line":"Rename the 'Gym admin' choice and label to 'Front desk'","fix_size":"small"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-phone-shop-2-02","date":"2026-11-26","surface":"phone","area":"phone/shop-2","refs":["F-phone-427"],"proof":"code-read","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open","lens":"gap-10","severity":"S3","title":"'Send your report to the gym?' lists less than the report holds, and more people than it names can open it","what":"The ask says the gym gets your exercises, sets, weights, reps and notes, seen by the owner and desk. The file sent is the full workout spreadsheet: it also holds the time each workout started and ended, how long sets lasted, effort scores, workout titles and descriptions, and cardio distance, speed, incline and level. On the server any signed-in staff of the gym can download it, trainers included.","expected":"The ask names everything the file holds (at least the workout times and cardio details) and everyone at the gym who can open it, or the file is cut down to what the ask says.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/shop/gymReport.ts:94-97","apps/mobile/src/shop/gymReportMake.ts:17-27","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/historyExport.ts:35-57","supabase/migrations/0045_report_requests.sql:26-28"],"root_cause_key":"report-ask-lists-too-little","who":"members whose gym asks for a report","how_often":"every report ask","fix_line":"Add the missing items and who can open it to the ask, or send fewer columns","fix_size":"small"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-words-phone-shop-2-03","date":"2026-11-26","surface":"phone","area":"phone/shop-2","refs":["F-phone-422"],"proof":"code-read","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open","lens":"gap-10","severity":"S4","title":"'Ask my trainer for help' says your trainer will get in touch, but the trainer is never told","what":"When the old one-tap help button shows (the trainer question page could not be read), the member is told 'Sent. Your trainer will get in touch.' The server only stamps a time on the member's row; no alert or pop-up goes to the trainer or owner. The trainer sees it only if they happen to open the trainer list.","expected":"The trainer (or the owner when there is none) gets an alert, or the words say the trainer will see it next time they look at their list.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/shop/trainerShare.ts:37-41","apps/mobile/src/app/settings/gym-sees.tsx:178-183","supabase/migrations/0050_trainer_view.sql:354-366","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/trainerView.ts:165-199"],"root_cause_key":"help-tap-sends-no-alert","who":"members who share with trainers","how_often":"when the fallback button shows","fix_line":"Send a trainer alert on a help tap, or soften the words","fix_size":"small"}
